---
description: GridSeak gate is the authority at the edit boundary. Never flatten tiers.
alwaysApply: true
---

The harness hook — not this rule — is the authority.

Claude `PreToolUse` covers Edit/Write/MultiEdit and Bash. Cursor
`preToolUse` covers Write/StrReplace/Delete/Shell (`failClosed`)
plus `beforeShellExecution` for `rm` / `git rm`. Cursor `preToolUse`
does not enforce ask — tree-sitter-only is deny-with-reason.

Compiler/LSP callers → deny. Dirty ∩ stale → ask (rescan) on Claude;
deny-with-reason on Cursor preToolUse. After compact: `gridseak gate --card`.
